 "native": "545\n제5장부록\n1.9.3. 쿠키 사용 규칙\nSecure 속성 및 HttpOnly 속성 설정\n// 올바르지 않은 방법\n// Cookie c = new Cookie(“name”, “value”);\n// c.setMaxAge(60*60*24*365);\n// c.setSecure(false);\n// response.addCookie(c);\n// 올바른 방법\nCookie c = new Cookie(“name”, “value”);\nc.setMaxAge(-1); \nc.setSecure(true);\nresponse.addCookie(c);\nHttpOnly 속성 설정\n①Tomcat\n- Tomcat 5.5.28, Tomcat 6.0.19부터 지원\n- /conf/context.xml에 설정\n <?xml version=”1.0” encoding=”UTF-8”?> \n   <Context path=”/myWebApplicationPath” useHttpOnly=”true”> : \n②JEUS\n- JEUS 6.0 fix9부터 지원 (default가 true) \n- WEBMain.xml 또는 jeus-web-dd.xml에 설정\n<session-config>\n <session-cookie> \n   <jsessionid-name>JSESSIONID</jsessionid-name>\n   <version>0</version> \n   <domain>.tmax.co.kr</domain> \n   <path>/</path> \n   <max-age>-1</max-age> \n   <secure>false</secure> \n   <http-only>true</http-only> \n </session-cookie> \n</session-config>\n",
